 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                           MASTER SERVICES\n12 Rue de la République, 13001 Marseille, France                         AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR11 491509305\n\nFROM                                                                     FACTURÉ À\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                                                     Groupe Horizon SA\n12 Rue de la République                                                  45 Avenue Victor Hugo\n13001 Marseille                                                          69001 Lyon\nFrance                                                                   France\nVAT: FR11 491509305\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 23/04/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Atelier\nProvence SAS, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Marseille (\"Party A\"), and Groupe Horizon SA, with its registered\noffice at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo, Lyon (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Atelier Provence SAS / Pierre Martin\nParty B    Groupe Horizon SA / Sophie Bernard\nDate       23/04/2026",
